HOW DO MACHINES LEARN?

- You might be wondering how machines learn and asking yourself, “How do they do it?” To find out, this
    course guides you through two different technologies by which machine learning takes place:
    classical machine learning and members of a group of technologies called the deep learning
    ecosystem.

    Studying these two machine learning technologies is like looking under the hood of two automobiles
    one gasoline-driven and the other electric—to learn how each one makes the wheels turn. In this
    case, the two "engines" are classical machine learning and the deep learning ecosystem.